From: Michael Narine <michael@verita-ai.com>
Date: Fri, 09 Oct 2026 17:16:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Model.hpp: do not include OpenCASCADE-based STEP.hpp in headless builds

Model.hpp includes Format/STEP.hpp, which includes OpenCASCADE XCAF headers, only to
get the STEP progress typedefs and the "namespace fs = boost::filesystem" alias that
other translation units rely on.

Add Format/STEP_fwd.hpp with just those declarations (a forward declaration of
Step, the load-stage constants, ImportStepProgressFn, StepIsUtf8Fn and the fs
alias), and have Model.hpp include it instead of STEP.hpp when
SLIC3R_HEADLESS_MINIMAL is defined. The default build still includes STEP.hpp.

Purpose: Replace the STEP.hpp include in Model.hpp with forward declarations (new STEP_fwd.hpp) when SLIC3R_HEADLESS_MINIMAL is defined.
SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only
Upstream-Status: to be submitted
Orca-Base: v2.4.2
---
diff --git a/src/libslic3r/Format/STEP_fwd.hpp b/src/libslic3r/Format/STEP_fwd.hpp
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/libslic3r/Format/STEP_fwd.hpp
@@ -0,0 +1,25 @@
+// Forward declarations replacing Format/STEP.hpp (which pulls in OpenCASCADE) in Model.hpp
+// when the headless build (SLIC3R_HEADLESS_MINIMAL) has no STEP support.
+#pragma once
+#include <functional>
+#include <boost/filesystem/path.hpp>
+#include <boost/filesystem.hpp>
+
+// STEP.hpp used to introduce this alias globally; other translation units rely on it.
+namespace fs = boost::filesystem;
+
+namespace Slic3r {
+
+class Step;
+
+// load step stage
+const int LOAD_STEP_STAGE_READ_FILE          = 0;
+const int LOAD_STEP_STAGE_GET_SOLID          = 1;
+const int LOAD_STEP_STAGE_GET_MESH           = 2;
+const int LOAD_STEP_STAGE_NUM                = 3;
+const int LOAD_STEP_STAGE_UNIT_NUM           = 5;
+
+typedef std::function<void(int load_stage, int current, int total, bool& cancel)> ImportStepProgressFn;
+typedef std::function<void(bool isUtf8)> StepIsUtf8Fn;
+
+} // namespace Slic3r
diff --git a/src/libslic3r/Model.hpp b/src/libslic3r/Model.hpp
--- a/src/libslic3r/Model.hpp
+++ b/src/libslic3r/Model.hpp
@@ -23,7 +23,11 @@
 //BBS: add bbs 3mf
 #include "Format/bbs_3mf.hpp"
 //BBS: add step
+#ifdef SLIC3R_HEADLESS_MINIMAL
+#include "Format/STEP_fwd.hpp"
+#else
 #include "Format/STEP.hpp"
+#endif
 //BBS: add stl
 #include "Format/STL.hpp"
 #include "Format/OBJ.hpp"
